{"title": "Stop First, Size Second", "type": "One trick", "hooks": ["Don't pick your size first. Pick your stop, then size from it.", "Stop guessing your position size. Your stop decides it.", "Your stop goes where you're wrong. Not where it feels safe."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Don't pick your size first. Pick your stop, then size from it.", "text": "Stop first. Size second.", "chart": 0, "win": [20, 115], "show": 90}, {"kind": "question", "chart": 0, "badge": "Q1", "head": "Where's the stop?", "vo": "You buy the bounce off support. Where does the stop go? A hair below entry, far below, or just below the support?", "win": [20, 115], "options": ["A hair below the entry, to lose as little as possible", "Far below, so it is never hit", "Just below the support, outside the usual noise"], "answer": 2, "show": 90, "cues": [{"say": "", "do": "options"}, {"say": "", "do": "line", "price": 155.9, "label": "Support", "tone": "level"}, {"say": "", "do": "line", "price": 157.5, "label": "Entry", "tone": "entry"}]}, {"kind": "answer", "chart": 0, "head": "Just below support", "vo": "Just below the support, outside the usual noise. That's where the trade idea is proved wrong.", "cues": [{"say": "", "do": "line", "price": 151.07, "label": "Below support", "tone": "stop"}, {"say": "", "do": "line", "price": 156.29, "label": "Tight", "tone": "stop"}, {"say": "", "do": "line", "price": 109.24, "label": "Wide", "tone": "stop"}], "win": [20, 115], "reveal_to": 115, "carry": true}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "What each stop did", "show": 90, "vo": "The support gave way. The right stop was hit after one candle. A planned loss. The wide stop wasn't hit, but look where the price went.", "cues": [{"say": "the support gave way", "do": "reveal", "to": 94}, {"say": "look where the price went", "do": "mark", "i": 94, "label": "L", "side": "low", "tone": "red"}], "win": [20, 115]}, {"kind": "big", "text": "Wide stop, tiny position", "vo": "A stop far away makes each loss 